  "genericDescription": "Bee Refuge trades, automatically. Queens and Young Queens give the same species resource; groups of five Drones give Pixels.\n^blue;Upper Input: On/Off Switch (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower Input: Item Network Input^reset;\n^blue;Output: Item Network Output^reset;",
  "humanDescription": "Bees in, resources out. The Bee Refuge exchange, automated. It takes five matching drones for a payout.\n^blue;Upper Input: On/Off Switch (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower Input: Item Network Input^reset;\n^blue;Output: Item Network Output^reset;",
  "animation": "/objects/bees/fubeesgenetics/beeexchange/beeexchange.animation",
  "animationPosition": [
    -8,
    0
  ],
  "apexDescription": "An automated exchange with species-specific rates. Queens yield resources; batches of five matching drones yield Pixels.\n^blue;Upper Input: On/Off Switch (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower Input: Item Network Input^reset;\n^blue;Output: Item Network Output^reset;",
  "avianDescription": "A small glass chamber that sends bees to the refuge. Five drones of one kind are exchanged together.\n^blue;Upper Input: On/Off Switch (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower Input: Item Network Input^reset;\n^blue;Output: Item Network Output^reset;",
  "floranDescription": "Beesss vanish, treasuresss appear! Machine wantsss five matching dronesss.\n^blue;Upper Input: On/Off Switch (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower Input: Item Network Input^reset;\n^blue;Output: Item Network Output^reset;",
  "glitchDescription": "Analytical. Queens yield species-specific resources. Five drones of the same species yield Pixels.\n^blue;Upper Input: On/Off Switch (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower Input: Item Network Input^reset;\n^blue;Output: Item Network Output^reset;",
  "hylotlDescription": "A glass chamber automates the refuge exchange. Queens provide resources; five drones of one species provide Pixels.\n^blue;Upper Input: On/Off Switch (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower Input: Item Network Input^reset;\n^blue;Output: Item Network Output^reset;",
  "novakidDescription": "Bees beam out, payment rolls in. Takes five drones of the same kind to close that deal.\n^blue;Upper Input: On/Off Switch (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower Input: Item Network Input^reset;\n^blue;Output: Item Network Output^reset;",
